# Suits Cashier Frontend

Arabic RTL cashier app for a suits shop (محل البدل). UI copy and validation messages are in Arabic by default.

## Stack

- React 18 + Vite
- Tailwind CSS + Sass helpers
- React Router (`createBrowserRouter`)
- Formik + Yup for forms
- React Query (`react-query` v3) for **all** API server state
- Axios (`src/helpers/Api.js` → `api` / `BaseUrl`) as the HTTP client under React Query
- react-toastify, react-icons, framer-motion, flowbite-react

## Folder layout

- `src/pages/Auth/` — login and auth screens
- `src/pages/Admin/` — admin screens (users, etc.)
- `src/pages/user/` — cashier/shop-owner screens
- `src/helpers/` — API base URL, toasts, shared utils
- `src/hooks/` — shared React Query hooks for API reads/writes

## Conventions

- Prefer `className` over `class`
- Functional components + default exports
- Keep pages under their role folder (`Auth`, `Admin`, `user`)
- Do not invent English-first UI unless the user asks
